{"n": 146, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "146.webp", "text": "1t—258c\n\nHold crankshaft with Special Tool 11 2 300.\nCaution!\n\nRemove special tool before operating engine\nagain.\n\nDisconnect hose (5).\n\nRemove protective cover.\n\nInstallation;\n\nFirst tighten the cylinder head cover and then\nthe protective cover,\n\nLoosen bolts (1 and 2) and nut (3).\n\nLoosen and take toothed drive belt off of the\ncamshaft sprocket.\n\ntastallation.\n\nInstall and tighten toothed drive belt — see\n11.31 110 in Construction Group Repair\nManual.\n\nUnscrew bolts im order of 14 through 1 and\ntake off cylinder head.\n\nfastallanon\n\nKeep oi! out of cavities (danger of cracking\nblock, wrong torque values).\n\nClean cylinder head bolts.\n\nLubricate threads and bearing surfaces of bolt\nheads with oi! lightly.\n\nReplace cylinder head gasket.\n\nMeasure piston protrusion see 17:12 101.\nTighten bolts in arder of 1 through 14 in three\nsteps.\n\nTightening torque*\n\nAdjust valve clearance .- see 11 34 004.\n\nCheck static injection pump adjustment see\n13 51 005.\n\nIn 3rd step (cylinder head cover removed again\nafter running engine warm) tighten cylinder\nhead bolts to specified torque angle with Special\nTool 11 2 110 regardless of the engine tempera\nture.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["1t—258c", 0.461, 0.0252, 0.5547, 0.0497], ["Hold", 0.2624, 0.0696, 0.2847, 0.0802], ["crankshaft", 0.2888, 0.0696, 0.3379, 0.0802], ["with", 0.3425, 0.0703, 0.3627, 0.0802], ["Special", 0.3668, 0.0703, 0.3992, 0.0822], ["Tool", 0.4037, 0.0703, 0.4245, 0.0809], ["11", 0.4296, 0.0703, 0.4387, 0.0802], ["2", 0.4438, 0.0703, 0.4488, 0.0802], ["300.", 0.4529, 0.0703, 0.4706, 0.0809], ["Caution!", 0.2614, 0.0849, 0.3034, 0.0962], ["Remove", 0.2624, 0.1021, 0.3009, 0.1121], ["special", 0.304, 0.1028, 0.3349, 0.1141], ["tool", 0.3394, 0.1021, 0.3576, 0.1121], ["before", 0.3617, 0.1021, 0.3911, 0.1121], ["operating", 0.3946, 0.1041, 0.4387, 0.1147], ["engine", 0.4422, 0.1048, 0.4726, 0.1147